  <wpt lat="32.288000" lon="76.265800"><ele>1933</ele><name>Kareri Village Roadhead Trailhead</name><desc>Gaddi village roadhead initiating the trail alongside the Nyund stream.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.305000" lon="76.268000"><ele>2350</ele><name>Nyund Stream Crossing Bridge</name><desc>Wooden bridge crossing the roaring glacier-fed torrent.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.315000" lon="76.270000"><ele>2650</ele><name>Reoti Forest Campsite</name><desc>Streamside campsite surrounded by mixed oak and pine forest.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.325200" lon="76.273300"><ele>2947</ele><name>Kareri Sacred Glacial Lake &amp; Shiva Temple</name><desc>Crystal-clear high-altitude glacial tarn beneath Minkiani Pass with Shiva temple on the knoll.</desc></wpt>
